   "name": "derive_hate_attribution",
   "comment": "HATE_ATTRIBUTION_PREREG.md Sec2: attribution_locus is a RESIDUAL between the incident's own signal and the LIVE regard_for Concept's state (via tracks_concept) -- no prior incident -> first_encounter (hate cannot form on a first impression), signs agree (confirms the held pattern) -> global_other, signs disagree (an exception) -> specific_act. confirm_streak increments on global_other, resets to 0 otherwise (a single exception breaks the pattern -- prediction 4). Guarded by status pending->appraised so re-running run_rules() does not double-derive.",
